        answer: 1, hint: 'Think about bytes moved, and SELECT what you need.', hintb: 'কত byte নড়াচড়া করছে ভাবুন, যা দরকার তাই SELECT করুন।',
        why: 'Long values move to overflow pages, and every extra kilobyte per row means fewer rows per 16 KiB page — more reads, more buffer pool churn, more network.',
